<title>BELGIUM: Recticel steps up presence in Poland.</title>
<headline>Recticel steps up presence in Poland.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian foam and foam products maker Recticel said its Eurofoam venture bought the remaining 22 percent of the shares in Polopren from the Polish state.</p>
</text>
